Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:25.79,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\b1\bord0\fad(200,0)\t(1566,2108,\3c&HC7B11D&\blur1\c&HFFF6B9&\bord1)\c&HFBFEE6&\3c&HEEB72A&\pos(93,100.222)\an1}Difesa
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:25.79,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\b1\bord0\fad(200,0)\t(1486,2069,\3c&HC7B11D&\blur1\c&HFFF6B9&\bord1)\c&HFBFEE6&\3c&HEEB72A&\pos(93,116.222)\an1}Magia
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:20.49,Italics,Elymas,0,0,0,,Col fatto che Veruga\Nè riuscito a finire in tempo
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:25.79,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\b1\bord0\fad(200,0)\t(1236,1819,\3c&HC7B11D&\blur1\c&HFFF6B9&\bord1)\c&HFBFEE6&\3c&HEEB72A&\pos(93,131.333)\an1}Agilità
